      "uuid": "27e9b3df-f06f-47af-99ae-886e1f90e9eb"
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 1,
        "delta": {
          "type": "text_delta",
          "text": "Partly. A \"use when\" line makes it more likely Claude picks a skill, but nothing invokes skills automatically,"
        }
      },
      "session_id": "2bd4353c-9d27-4940-aa9f-a7b07a9c2a2d",
      "parent_tool_use_id": null,
      "uuid": "ab0413e3-5d52-4b7f-b812-4ab323e689a1"
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 1,
        "delta": {
          "type": "text_delta",
          "text": " and even an invoked skill doesn't guarantee its links get read.\n\n**How skills work in Claude Code**\n1. **Only the description is always there.** Each skill's name and description sit in the system prompt of every run. The body ("
        }
      },
      "session_id": "2bd4353c-9d27-4940-aa9f-a7b07a9c2a2d",
      "parent_tool_use_id": null,
      "uuid": "0db80d0f-1b2d-4d6d-be7c-60f40314c0ac"
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 1,
        "delta": {
          "type": "text_delta",
          "text": "`SKILL.md`) isn't loaded.\n2. **Claude decides whether to use one.** If it judges that a skill matches the task, it calls the"
        }
      },
      "session_id": "2bd4353c-9d27-4940-aa9f-a7b07a9c2a2d",
      "parent_tool_use_id": null,
      "uuid": "ee277639-5663-403f-94e7-431937aecf29"
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 1,
        "delta": {
          "type": "text_delta",
          "text": " Skill tool, and only then is the body loaded. \"Use when …\" is a hint for that decision, not a trigger.\n3. **Links in the body are optional reading.** Once lo"
        }
      },
      "session_id": "2bd4353c-9d27-4940-aa9f-a7b07a9c2a2d",
      "parent_tool_use_id": null,
      "uuid": "a99e4057-5002-430f-b828-ba4e7392e631"
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 1,
        "delta": {
          "type": "text_delta",
          "text": "aded, the body's links (such as `[ApplicationScope](../../reference/…)`) are still ordinary links. Claude reads the target only if it decides it needs to. Belay writes links rather than `@` imports on purpose, so"
        }
      },
      "session_id": "2bd4353c-9d27-4940-aa9f-a7b07a9c2a2d",
      "parent_tool_use_id": null,
      "uuid": "e650f745-d6d5-4207-b4bf-a00b3ce19233"
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 1,
        "delta": {
          "type": "text_delta",
          "text": " nothing is pulled in automatically.\n\nSo there are two separate decisions, each made by the model: invoke the skill, then open the links.\n\n**Your history"
        }
      },
      "session_id": "2bd4353c-9d27-4940-aa9f-a7b07a9c2a2d",
      "parent_tool_use_id": null,
      "uuid": "499fa559-0c53-4979-8389-02edd8561692"
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 1,
        "delta": {
          "type": "text_delta",
          "text": " shows both usually go the other way**\n- **Skills:** in about 150 task runs since the first day, the Skill tool was called essentially never, even"
        }
      },
      "session_id": "2bd4353c-9d27-4940-aa9f-a7b07a9c2a2d",
      "parent_tool_use_id": null,
      "uuid": "e928e46c-29da-478e-9044-b64b59d2122a"
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 1,
        "delta": {
          "type": "text_delta",
          "text": " with 21 `build-*` skills available.\n- **Links:** in your last 40 runs, 31 prompts linked to reference docs, and Claude opened one in only 4 runs.\n\n**Why your sk"
